  "title": "AS Watson Expands Partnership With NCR Voyix Through Global Voyix Commerce Platform Agreement",
  "summary": "AS Watson will adopt the Voyix Commerce Platform, deploying Voyix POS, self-checkout, loyalty and managed services across select retail brands and markets in Europe and Asia, including Watsons in Hong Kong, Malaysia and the Philippines; Superdrug and Savers in the U.K.; Kruidvat in the Netherlands; and Drogas in Latvia.",
